        <h2 class="mt-3" id="validation">Production validation boundaries</h2>
        <div class="site-panel site-panel--soft p-6">
          <ul class="site-list text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--text-2)]">
            <li><strong>Component compatibility:</strong> These containers reproduce Apache Spark, Hadoop, and Hive runtime semantics. They do not simulate the Google Cloud Dataproc REST control plane (such as cluster provisioning RPCs, auto-scaling policies, or Compute Engine VM lifecycle).</li>
            <li><strong>Permitted use:</strong> The proprietary Public Preview License permits individuals and organizations, including for-profit companies, to use LocalCloud for non-production internal development, testing, CI, evaluation, and internal pilots.</li>
            <li><strong>Production verification:</strong> Always validate production jobs and infrastructure definitions against real Google Cloud Dataproc before deploying to production.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
